OL,3,GNEWSA'I was beating adults at chess
OL,4,Awhen I was eight'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"When I was eight or nine I was beating
OL,7,Fadults at chess and they were raging
OL,8,Fwhen they lost, like 'I just lost to a
OL,9,Flittle kid'."
OL,11,FEthan first became interested in chess
OL,12,Fwhen he was six years old after he
OL,13,Fspotted someone else playing.
OL,15,FNow 13, he plays for Strand Chess Club
OL,16,Fin east Belfast and has represented
OL,17,FIreland through all his age groups.
OL,19,FLast week he became the youngest Ulster
OL,20,Fchess champion in history ` not just in
OL,21,Fhis age category but across all ages.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
